Suppose $\ensuremath{\mathop{\pmb{K}}} = \<K_\beta\>_{\beta \in \ensuremath{\omega}_1}$ is a weak Knight system (for $\mathcal{I}$ and $\ensuremath{\mathop{\pmb{\tau}}}$). We say $\ensuremath{\mathop{\pmb{K}}}$ is a {\bf{Knight system}} if 

